            "notes": "[Phantasm](item_21ed9c3d-7a54-438f-9188-f21fd7a7dbfb) is a really solid first Power because it's useful in a variety of builds, so you can pivot if you need to after the first round.\n\nI like to keep things balanced with [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) and [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418). \n\nI prefer [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) but any of the standard defensive items like [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) or [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) can be fine. Choose at least one defensive item to maximize your uptime during the first round so you can generate plenty of cash.",
