            "notes": "I go for [Optimal Overflow](item_9d85ca48-b27a-435a-8ef9-247440e0f97d) here. Since I'm stacking so much ability power, my Grasp isn't doing a ton. Plus, by healing my team, I'm still throwing out damage orbs. \n\nThis round we pick up [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) or [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505), whichever you didn't choose last round. We also should have enough to get into [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) if you haven't already. \n\nIf you are rolling in funds, [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) will be the next pickup as it extends our orb and debuff range, meaning more debuff uptime.\n\nUse up all your cash to fill in with ability power items.",
