            "notes": "This round we'll continue to build out our items. You should have [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) by now. You can also sell [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) for [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce) and then continue building from there. \n\nIf you're surviving fine, add more ability power and cooldown reduction, or grab some survival items to help keep you afloat. I find that  [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927) can be a really nice middle ground here for both power and lifesteal.\n\nIf you're running out of healing juice too often, pick up [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) to help manage your resources.",
